WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:00.666
- What the-

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:02.166
I think Josh is holding me back again.

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:03.791
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Hello, Stefon Diggs.

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:06.166
For years, you've angrily thrown tablets.

00:00:06.166 --> 00:00:09.041
But today,
the tablet is going to throw you.

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:13.041
You have 5 seconds to simply say, I do not
blame anyone else for my problems.

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:14.041
Clock starts now.

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:15.416
- [Countdown:] Five, four...

00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:16.541
- [Diggs:] I do not...
- [Countdown:] Three, two...

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:17.541
- [Diggs:] I can't do it.
- [Countdown:] One.

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:19.041
- Throw me.

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.958
- Well, they finally caught Kelce.

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:25.666
- My first professional death trap.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:27.291
So blessed. Hahaha.

00:00:27.291 --> 00:00:29.875
- Oh, God. Did they kill Belichick?

00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.291
- That explains the last few seasons.

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:33.083
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Would you like to play a game?

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:33.916
- [All:] Yes!

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:36.166
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Sorry, I should clarify. Not a football game.

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:37.666
- [All:] No.
- [Kelce:] Boo!

00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:41.041
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Aaron, you cheated Father Time with your injury recovery.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.083
- Medicine is a lie, Mr. Pfizer.

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:47.583
- [Off-Screen Voice:] You can leave so long as you walk
across... Artificial Turf.

00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:48.916
- [All:] AHHHH!

00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:52.416
- OH, GOD. OH NO! Grass exists for a reason!

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.333
- YOU SICK FREAK!

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:55.916
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Bijan Robinson.

00:00:55.916 --> 00:01:00.416
You made the mortal sin of having a headache during a game.

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:03.041
- Well, gee, sir, I sure am sorry
if I offended.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:04.416
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Next to you is a razor.

00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:08.333
Either cut off your own hand...
or your coach’s awesome new mustache.

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.541
- Please, Bijan. You're a running back.

00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:11.666
You only need one hand.

00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:13.291
- I'm so sorry, Coach.

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:14.041
(whimpers)

00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:16.041
- AHHH, it hurts so bad!

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:18.666
Now I just look like any other billionaire’s son.

00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:21.041
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Travis, you committed one of the worst sins,

00:01:21.041 --> 00:01:22.541
distracting from the precious game.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.166
- That is not blessed, bro.

00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:26.416
- Kill me, but don’t get any blood on the Kelly Green jerseys.

00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:27.625
They’re just too clean.

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:28.291
- Let him go.

00:01:28.291 --> 00:01:29.791
- [Off-Screen Voice:] I will. You just have to tweet.

00:01:29.791 --> 00:01:31.666
“Taylor's Era’s Tour is a great show,

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:34.833
but Beyonce's Renaissance Tour is an Experience.”

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.166
- I'm sorry, Tay.

00:01:36.166 --> 00:01:38.166
I'm trying so hard to be a gentleman.

00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:40.666
- [Off-Screen Voice:] I release you to the Swifties.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:43.333
- [Swifities:] How dare you? / She’s gonna destroy you! / Through song! 

00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:44.416
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Puka. Cooper.

00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:46.166
There can only be one of you.

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.416
- Oh, I don't think I'm going to kill Puka Nacua. 

00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:50.166
- Aw. Same to you, bro.

00:01:50.166 --> 00:01:52.291
- [Off-Screen Voice:] THEN DEAL WITH: THE BLADES OF DEATH! 

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:54.041
- Joke's on you. We're Rams.

00:01:54.041 --> 00:01:56.333
We only know how to deal
with opposing fans.

00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:59.041
- You'll never get us, bro. Life is too beautiful.

00:01:59.041 --> 00:02:01.916
- [Off-Screen Voice:] You thought I was dead, but what is truly evil will never die.

00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:03.416
- Just ask the Bills.

00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:04.416
Game over.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:05.416
- AHH!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.625
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Dan Campbell, I'd like to play a game.

00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:10.375
You were-

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:12.250
- Let's do it!! Ahhh!!!

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.291
- [Off-Screen Voice:] Wait, no, just use the key! This isn't THE test. 

00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:15.125
- I'm fired up, baby!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.000
You saw us.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.166
We saw you right back.

00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:18.166
I don't need feet.

00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:19.250
I need YARDS!

